 "AN_ARITHMETIC_COINCIDENCE_FLAGGED_NOT_CLAIMED": "The predeclaration's motivating figures were 6.5x (b^3) against 1.9x (b). Measured Q(2) = 6.435 and Q(2)/Q(0) = 2.035. Close enough to be worth checking and NOT offered as agreement: Q(2) is a control-over-band curvature ratio and b^3 is a bias compounding factor. Matching numbers across different quantities is the definite-description problem in numeric form. Flagged for the routing lane to accept or dismiss.",
